/a1c8005c52130303d0cbc4a12fc1f3a40a3db87ab36cd287f50283ab80bf3832.png)\n\nThus, $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$. Reversing traversal reverses the work: $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r=-\\oint_C\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r$. The reversed path $-C$ is **clockwise**.\n\n![](images/21/21bf5177e22c35424fe2e1c4f3790d7c6a783b8fdc3f02c2c11c90068b56f36f.png)\n\nTherefore, $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r < 0$.\n\nI. $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$ is **false**.\n\nII. $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$ is **true**.\n\nIII. $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r < 0$ is **true**.\n\nThe true statements are II and III only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186709129 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "97047065-f6a0-5466-a56a-bfabb34c1b9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709141} {:answer/id #uuid "9cd5f12c-a7ea-5be9-a764-11f1d00e24a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709142}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9cd5f12c-a7ea-5be9-a764-11f1d00e24a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709142} :answer-field/id #uuid "29ac5e3d-1c93-549e-95eb-df663a45919e" :answer-field/key "$\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r = 0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709120} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a218110-adfa-546f-a875-7a5a7a9035ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709128} {:answer/id #uuid "bb4a9d61-ca02-5550-88a7-86fede574ea2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/