"The circulation $\\Gamma=\\oint_C\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r$ measures the work done around a *closed* curve. Assistance gives positive work, opposition gives negative work, and perpendicular force gives zero work.\n\nThe field opposes the motion all the way around $C$ in the **counterclockwise** direction.\n\n![](images/b9/b92a2640f547afc8866524c6af86754b7f7851027e2d8e8a5f0e905866cbe5b8.png)\n\nThus, $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r < 0$. Reversing traversal reverses the work: $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r=-\\oint_C\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r$. The reversed path $-C$ is **clockwise**.\n\n![](images/2a/2a790a4afed6db8cc1a476b3793a64ba10ea11f94d18e7764189eaa6f694aec0.png)\n\nTherefore, $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$.\n\n- $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$ is **true**.\n\n- $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r = 0$ is **false**.\n\n- $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r < 0$ is **true**.\n\nTherefore, select $\\oint_{-C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$ and $\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r < 0$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186709152 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65d36cc8-e873-5ea8-89da-08937768bbe6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709131} {:answer/id #uuid "9204b809-c649-5a6f-8103-1e6da3b41667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709139}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9204b809-c649-5a6f-8103-1e6da3b41667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186709139} :answer-field/id #uuid "3aa6f3d4-5b54-5713-b266-0097dbd5348d" :answer-field/key "$\\oint_{C}\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathrm d\\mathbf r > 0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db